<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 73,494.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 73,494.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Oct 28 totaled 73,494 bales, up from 68,631 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 4,881 bales issued, 1,417 decertification orders, no cancellations, and 3,698 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
